OL,3,GNEWSAGolf course housing plan submitted
OL,4,Ato council
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build more than 450 homes on a
OL,7,Fhistoric golf course in Nottinghamshire
OL,8,Fhave been formally lodged.
OL,10,FThe former family-run Beeston Fields
OL,11,FGolf Club was founded in 1923 but was
OL,12,Fsold to Cilldara Group in November
OL,13,F2024.
OL,15,FInitial plans submitted to Broxtowe
OL,16,FBorough Council in July, which included
OL,17,Fup to 500 homes, a care home and a
OL,18,Fpark, prompted protests that the area
OL,19,Fwas losing its "green lung".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
