OL,3,GNEWSAGolf course housing plan submitted
OL,4,Ato council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new outline plans are for 460
OL,7,Fproperties and include two thirds of
OL,8,Fthe site being made into landscape
OL,9,Fcorridors, natural spaces and parkland,
OL,10,Fmaking "previously private green space
OL,11,Fopen to the public".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
